WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.901
-Every time you come on,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.035
you always do something
above and beyond.

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.437
Thank you for playing
that game with us.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.206
And I always kind of
put you to the test

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:07.807
and make you do impressions
or something.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.608
I know -- You're like,
"I know, Jimmy.

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:10.977
I have a job
on 'Saturday Night Live.'

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:12.545
"I don't need to audition."
-They're just impressions.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.980
-But I do love your impressions.
-Okay.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.016
-And I was wondering
if you could do a bunch of them

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:19.151
and how many
you could do in 60 seconds.

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:21.454
If I just name the names,
could you just do a little --

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:22.989
Even if it's a snippet.
-A snippet?

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.624
-Just a little sound effect,

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:27.093
something of the names of
people that you do.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.261
Is that possible?
-Yeah.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:31.531
I want to get as many
as humanly possible.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.999
I'm a competitor.
-Alright.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.368 line:0%
Alright, let's --
Let's go. Alright, ready?

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.970 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.572 line:0%
-Alright.
-Okay.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.574 line:0%
-60 seconds on the clock.
Ready?

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.975 line:0%
Go! Meryl Streep.

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:47.280 line:0%
-Oh, well, I have 600 Oscars.

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:53.787 line:0%
Jimmy, you and I
are kindred spirits.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:01:00.994 line:0%
You know, you asked me on a date
once, and you said "norr."

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:05.298 line:0%
Y'all, I just freakin'
love Oprah.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.470 line:0%
[ Laughs ]
Na, na, na, na.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.441 line:0%
Oh.
[ Laughs ]

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.243 line:0%
Yaaaas!

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.647 line:0%
Oh. Okay, pretend I have knives.

00:01:23.949 --> 00:01:26.985 line:0%
Whoa! Jimmy Fallon!
It is crazy that I'm here!

00:01:26.985 --> 00:01:29.756 line:0%
Oh, and I have a bow!

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.458 line:0%
Shia LaBeouf?!
-Yeah.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:34.961 line:0%
-Yo, what's up?
What's good, Jimmy Fallon?

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.565 line:0%
