00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.538 line:0%
Oh, God, I-I can't see.
I got my contacts on.

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.706 line:0%
-Oh, my God!
-No!

00:01:47.706 --> 00:01:48.841 line:0%
-That is unbelievable.

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:51.910
That is how you do it!

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:54.713
Chloe Fineman, everybody!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:55.881
